  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: 
  description: 'This scene demonstrates how the agent can follow gameObjects dynamically
    when they move, by setting the follow attribute to true.


    Use the scene
    view during play mode to inspect the scene freely while the agent is walking
    around.


    If Objects are changed in the scene: Select the GameObject "NavMesh
    Surface" and bake the NavMesh again before running the scene.'
  type: 0
  url: 
